but before that, they'll grow flowers!

1421
00:13:56,917 --> 00:14:01,197
Please take care not to let 
the school find out this is a farm.

1422
00:14:01,197 --> 00:14:02,657
Catarina-sama!

1423
00:14:02,657 --> 00:14:04,457
We're going to have a tea party with—

1424
00:14:07,927 --> 00:14:09,927
S-Sister...

1425
00:14:10,237 --> 00:14:11,637
Catarina...

1426
00:14:13,907 --> 00:14:17,007
You're still messing 
with that stuff, even here?

1427
00:14:17,007 --> 00:14:19,317
That look suits you.

1428
00:14:19,317 --> 00:14:21,507
Yes, it puts the mind at ease.

1429
00:14:21,507 --> 00:14:24,047
Really? Thanks!

1430
00:14:26,807 --> 00:14:29,137
<i>It's a rule at this school that the students</i>

1431
00:14:29,137 --> 00:14:32,807
<i>who score high on tests 
join the student council.</i>

1432
00:14:32,807 --> 00:14:34,597
<i>Just like in the game, as expected,</i>

1433
00:14:32,807 --> 00:14:36,817
1st      Geordo Stuart

1434
00:14:32,807 --> 00:14:36,817
1st      Geordo Stuart

