1464
00:15:49,807 --> 00:15:54,647
Student Council Office

1465
00:15:50,117 --> 00:15:53,547
<i>My friends joining the student council 
was just like in the game.</i>

1466
00:15:53,847 --> 00:15:55,557
<i>What was different about it</i>

1467
00:15:55,557 --> 00:15:59,187
<i>was that I started going to 
the student council office a lot, too.</i>

1468
00:16:04,107 --> 00:16:06,607
Thank you for the tea.

1469
00:16:06,607 --> 00:16:09,057
I'm not interrupting your work, am I?

1470
00:16:09,057 --> 00:16:11,607
No, not at all.

1471
00:16:11,607 --> 00:16:15,667
Since the first-years joined, 
my work is much easier, anyway.

1472
00:16:15,667 --> 00:16:20,627
Speaking of, you and Nicol-sama 
are the only second-years, right?

1473
00:16:20,627 --> 00:16:23,297
Yes. There were more of us before,

1474
00:16:23,297 --> 00:16:24,047
He's mine!

1475
00:16:23,477 --> 00:16:26,627
but they kept getting into fights over Nicol.

1476
00:16:24,007 --> 00:16:25,007
No, he's mine!

1477
00:16:25,007 --> 00:16:26,637
Like hell! He's mine!

1478
00:16:26,917 --> 00:16:30,677
<i>Nicol's devilish charm 
is in full swing here, too.</i>

1479
00:16:31,287 --> 00:16:33,377
I'll be working over there.

1480
00:16:33,377 --> 00:16:35,407
Let me know if you need anything.

1481
00:16:35,407 --> 00:16:37,817
Okay, thank you.

1482
00:16:38,597 --> 00:16:41,437
<i>Since the president welcomes me so warmly,</i>

1483
00:16:41,437 --> 00:16:44,147
<i>I've found myself spending 
a lot more time here.</i>

1484
00:16:44,297 --> 00:16:45,627
<i>And, of course,</i>

1485
00:16:45,627 --> 00:16:50,027
<i>that leads to interactions 
with the other council members...</i>

1486
00:16:50,407 --> 00:16:51,447
Claes-sama...

1487
00:16:51,847 --> 00:16:54,867
Please help yourself to these, if you'd like.

1488
00:16:56,227 --> 00:16:58,397
Thank you, Campbell-san.

1489
00:17:00,937 --> 00:17:04,217
<i>Maria-chan's such a nice, sweet girl!</i>

1490
00:17:04,547 --> 00:17:05,787
I'll have some, then.

1491
00:17:08,357 --> 00:17:10,857
These are delicious!

1492
00:17:10,857 --> 00:17:14,097
They were a gift given 
to the student council.

1493
00:17:14,097 --> 00:17:17,557
By the way, do you ever bring 
any of the sweets you make?

1494
00:17:17,557 --> 00:17:18,477
Huh?

1495
00:17:22,697 --> 00:17:24,277
<i>Wait, did I just...</i>

1496
00:17:24,277 --> 00:17:26,897
Make some sweets for me!

1497
00:17:26,897 --> 00:17:29,117
<i>...make that sound like a threat?!</i>

1498
00:17:29,307 --> 00:17:31,167
U-Um, that is...

1499
00:17:31,167 --> 00:17:34,587
I don't mean to force you 
into making them or anything...

1500
00:17:36,337 --> 00:17:41,047
Um... How did you know that I make sweets?

1501
00:17:41,137 --> 00:17:43,447
U-Uh...

1502
00:17:43,617 --> 00:17:46,507
<i>I can't tell her I saw it in a game!</i>

1503
00:17:46,647 --> 00:17:50,557
I think I heard it from one 
of the cooks in the cafeteria...

1504
00:17:50,557 --> 00:17:52,417
Oh, so that's it.

1505
00:17:52,417 --> 00:17:57,267
I do borrow the school's kitchen 
to make sweets sometimes.

1506
00:17:57,697 --> 00:18:01,607
But I don't make anything good 
enough to serve the council...

1507
00:18:01,767 --> 00:18:04,337
I do like high-class sweets,

1508
00:18:04,337 --> 00:18:06,487
but I love homemade ones, too!

1509
00:18:06,487 --> 00:18:08,417
What? You do?

1510
00:18:08,417 --> 00:18:09,147
Yes!

1511
00:18:09,477 --> 00:18:13,487
The head maid at my mansion used to 
make sweets for me all the time.

1512
00:18:15,847 --> 00:18:20,457
I've been missing the taste 
of those sweets since I came here...

1513
00:18:20,457 --> 00:18:21,957
Oh, I see.

1514
00:18:21,957 --> 00:18:23,657
If you don't mind,

1515
00:18:23,657 --> 00:18:27,017
I'd be really happy 
if you'd share a few with me...

1516
00:18:28,067 --> 00:18:29,277
Okay.

1517
00:18:29,277 --> 00:18:31,267
I don't know if you'll like them,

1518
00:18:31,267 --> 00:18:33,057
but I'll make some for you sometime.

1519
00:18:33,127 --> 00:18:35,197
Thanks!

1520
00:18:37,707 --> 00:18:41,597
I've waited so long to eat 
Maria-chan's homemade sweets!

1521
00:18:41,947 --> 00:18:44,177
Hm? What's this?

1522
00:18:45,607 --> 00:18:49,407
Something smells delightfully 
fragrant and delicious...

1523
00:18:49,827 --> 00:18:51,317
It's coming from over there!

1524
00:18:54,807 --> 00:18:56,247
Campbell-san!

1525
00:18:58,117 --> 00:19:00,657
Don't think you're special 
because everyone fawns over you!

1526
00:19:00,977 --> 00:19:05,917
You were going to give the student 
council cheap food made by a commoner?

1527
00:19:05,917 --> 00:19:07,797
These couldn't be more unfit for them!

1528
00:19:09,347 --> 00:19:10,097
Stop it!

1529
00:19:11,507 --> 00:19:14,337
C-Catarina Claes-sama?

1530
00:19:16,547 --> 00:19:19,007
What do all of you think you're doing?

1531
00:19:19,307 --> 00:19:22,517
<i>What have they done 
to Maria-chan's homemade sweets?</i>

1532
00:19:22,807 --> 00:19:26,107
<i>Such a crime... is unforgivable!</i>

1533
00:19:26,977 --> 00:19:30,527
W-We're so sorry!

1534
00:19:32,037 --> 00:19:34,777
<i>Having the face 
of a villainess paid off bigtime.</i>

1535
00:19:37,067 --> 00:19:39,377
But, gosh...

1536
00:19:42,997 --> 00:19:45,377
These smell so good!

1537
00:19:47,507 --> 00:19:49,457
Delicious!

1538
00:19:49,747 --> 00:19:53,167
<i>It's gentle on the tongue 
and has the perfect level of sweetness!</i>

1539
00:19:53,167 --> 00:19:55,927
<i>This would rank among 
the best sweets in history!</i>

1540
00:20:04,047 --> 00:20:06,877
I'm stuffed!

1541
00:20:09,447 --> 00:20:12,117
<i>O-Oh, no!</i>

1542
00:20:12,117 --> 00:20:15,237
<i>I got carried away and ate them all!</i>

1543
00:20:15,557 --> 00:20:17,717
I-I'm sorry!

1544
00:20:17,717 --> 00:20:20,637
No, I don't mind that...

1545
00:20:20,637 --> 00:20:23,217
It's just that those were on the ground...

1546
00:20:23,217 --> 00:20:25,307
They only fell onto the grass.

1547
00:20:25,307 --> 00:20:28,237
They were hardly dirty at all, 
so there's no problem!

1548
00:20:28,237 --> 00:20:29,827
I-I see...

1549
00:20:29,957 --> 00:20:31,857
But really,

1550
00:20:31,857 --> 00:20:36,387
these are just as good 
as anything a professional would make!

1551
00:20:36,387 --> 00:20:37,927
They were delicious!

1552
00:20:40,267 --> 00:20:42,097
Thank you.

1553
00:20:42,097 --> 00:20:44,287
<i>Sh-She's so cute!</i>

1554
00:20:44,287 --> 00:20:46,517
<i>No wonder she's an otome game heroine!</i>

1555
00:20:46,517 --> 00:20:49,647
<i>This would make anyone's heart skip a beat!</i>

1556
00:20:49,647 --> 00:20:51,397
So this is where you've been.

1557
00:20:51,637 --> 00:20:53,317
What are you doing?

1558
00:20:55,197 --> 00:20:56,197
Catarina?

